ngs.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_12","text":"How did everyone manage to recover their sense of taste?","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_13","text":"It seems to return automatically after about an hour.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_14","text":"There are some exceptions who get it back quicker than others.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_15","text":"You can also get it back immediately if you drink some carbonated drinks or eat some chocolate.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_16","text":"They give your mouth a good washing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_17","text":"They reset the taste buds, or something along those lines.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_18","text":"Carbonated drinks, or chocolate...","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_19","text":"Yep.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_20","text":"I'd give you some,","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_21","text":"but we're busy handling all the people here.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_miraclesnow1_04_e_22","t